              Tell it what
              <br />
              to try.
            </h2>
          </div>
          <p data-stagger="" className="m-0 max-w-[34em] text-[18px] leading-normal text-ink2 fu-pretty">
            Test one journey now, or let it read your site first and suggest which journeys are worth testing.
          </p>
