            </p>
          )}
        </div>
        <div className="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <SubHead>
            How it appears to make money
            <span className="fu-chip fu-chip-tag ml-1 border-dashed border-ink bg-amber-soft text-amber-ink">Inferred</span>
